        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. \r\rSapienza&apos;s elite are outraged by OnlyFans creators Bella Carillo and Cesario Bolognese, whose success threatens the town&apos;s respectable image. Mayor Marco Abiatti has requested their removal, along with their manager and bodyguard. Four targets, one discreet contract. Let&apos;s restore some order to this picturesque Italian town.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
